{
  "title": "The Present and the Future",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Present_and_the_Future?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Present and the Future</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Complete <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Dreamcatchers_in_the_Secret_Gardens\" title=\"Dreamcatchers in the Secret Gardens\">Dreamcatchers in the Secret Gardens</a></i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_II\" title=\"Chapter II\">Chapter II</a>&#58; Act VII</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">You return to Ragunna to see whether the aftermath of the Fabricatorium of the Deep reached the people there, but unexpectedly run into Zani in the city. Might as well talk to her to catch up with the situation.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Medium Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Medium Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152915\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Energy_Core\" title=\"Medium Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Medium Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/18/Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153056\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 8,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zani\" title=\"Zani\">Zani</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>The Present and the Future</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Ragunna_City\" title=\"Ragunna City\">Ragunna City</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]]. It is an Afterstory to <a href=\"/wiki/Dreamcatchers_in_the_Secret_Gardens\" title=\"Dreamcatchers in the Secret Gardens\">Dreamcatchers in the Secret Gardens</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Glossary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Glossary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to Zani</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing this quest awards the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Rover%27s_Journey_II\" title=\"Rover&#39;s Journey II\">Rover's Journey II</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/End_Note,_Start_Note\" title=\"End Note, Start Note\">End Note, Start Note</a></i>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> (I wonder if the unrest here has spread to Ragunna. I'd better return and check it out.)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You return to Ragunna to see whether the aftermath of the Fabricatorium of the Deep reached the people there, but unexpectedly run into Zani in the city. Might as well talk to her to catch up with the situation.</div></div></dd>\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> No one's been affected. Yes, no worries. Leave the rest to me.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Zani? Why are you here?</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> Ah, it's you. What a coincidence.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> A short yet violent quake hit Ragunna not long ago. We still don't know the cause, but we're checking for casualties.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> Fortunately, the damage seems minimal.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> (Tell her about the Fabricatorium of the Deep.)</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> That explains the commotion. I didn't expect the Order to have a research facility hidden deep underwater.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> Sounds like a whole mess to clean up there.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> I'll report everything to Ms. Carlotta. With the Common Echoes involved, the families, the Order... No, the entire city will need to unite.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> Thank you for bringing this information to us.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> About the Journeying Paradise...</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> If what Fenrico said is true, the Order should make the right choice here.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> But that's not something I need to worry about at my pay grade.</dd>\n<dd><b>Zani:</b> If the situation in Septimont is still unclear, you should go there first. Don't worry about us. Ragunna will be fine.</dd>\n<dd><b>Black Shores Member:</b> Finally! (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), we've been trying to reach you, but we kept losing the connection.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cartethyia:</b> Are you alrigth?!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> You couldn't reach me? Must've been due to the chaotic frequencies at the seabed. Relax, I'm fine.</dd>\n<dd><b>Black Shores Member:</b> That's a relief. You mentioned the seabed. Have you discovered anything?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yes, and I have something to say to Cartethyia.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> You were right. The Threnodian's power at the seabed came from Mya.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> It crystallized within a Gem, luring Fenrico to open a rift for the Dark Tide to seep through. It tried to escape back into the Tide to merge with the remaining Threnodian power to grow stronger.</dd>\n<dd><b>Black Shores Member:</b> You mean the <a href=\"#Glossary\">Threnodian's Gem</a> caused the Dark Tide? But we didn't detect any anomalous frequencies in Rinascita.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> That's the very anomaly we're investigating.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cartethyia:</b> That's strange. The Dark Tide at the seabed... It's different from what I've seen before. In Ragunna, it always come from the sky.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cartethyia:</b> Hmm... could you describe the Dark Tide you encountered in more detail?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> It was like the crack in a shattered crystal.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> It was an interior space where light and dark converged.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Swarms of Tacet Discords emerged from it.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Fenrico called it the Journeying Paradise.</dd>\n<dd><b>Cartethyia:</b> I see... I'll need some time to think it through.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Sure. I'm heading to Septimont to follow the clues Fenrico left behind.</dd>\n<dd><b>Black Shores Member:</b> Please take care of yourself. We'll keep you updated with any developments.</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Glossary\">Glossary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Threnodian's Gem - Lingering power of the Threnodian Leviathan. After escaping from Mya's broken form, it concealed itself within the Ragunna gemstone on her helmet.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>The Present and the Future</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">现状与未来</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">現狀與